# Contact form endpoint (optional).
#
# Any service that accepts a JSON POST with { name, email, subject, message }
# works, for example Formspree: https://formspree.io/f/your-form-id
#
# Copy this file to `.env.local` and fill in the URL. When it is empty, the
# form opens the visitor's email app with the message pre-filled instead.
VITE_CONTACT_ENDPOINT=
